WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.760
Give me Mr. Dohyuk’s cell phone

2
00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:50.140
If I don't give it, are you going to kill me?

3
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.100
Is Jieyin a hostage?

4
00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:04.990
Why does everyone have so many injuries?

5
00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:09.820
I miss you and Jieyin too

6
00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:11.800
Don't say this

7
00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:15.340
Where have you been all this time?

8
00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:18.300
Does dad know?
What happened between you and Teacher Daohyuk?

9
00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:24.920
So it was dad who killed Teacher Dohyuk?

10
00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:26.700
Is there any evidence?

11
00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:28.170
Videos on your phone…

12
00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:30.900
That only proves that he has a motive
There's no way to prove he committed murder.

13
00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:32.180
Is there any direct evidence?

14
00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:32.680
I…

15
00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:34.160
I am a witness

16
00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:36.490
Is that why you dare not go home?

17
00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:40.210
You don't know how scary dad is

18
00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:42.680
Give me Teacher Yu’s mobile phone

19
00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.000
Didn't you look for it? It's not here with me.

20
00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:47.590
But what if you get the phone?

21
00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:52.550
Can you really keep your promise?

22
00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:56.890
Jay

23
00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.950
I...I'm really going crazy

24
00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.620
The teacher’s family also has the right to know the truth

25
00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:06.180
You calm down first

26
00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:08.560
This is a human head phone

27
00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.020
I'll get the teacher's cell phone
Wait for my call

28
00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:12.910
I won't tell anyone that I saw you

29
00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:14.330
you don't have to worry

30
00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:16.140
I've made an appointment to meet

31
00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:17.210
who

32
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.900
Who did you make an appointment with?

33
00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:25.900
Are you really unable to contact Xiuzhen?

34
00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:30.200
Damn, is she dead?

35
00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.670
It's like she suddenly disappeared
No one knows where she went

36
00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.039
Hello Yu Seqi

37
00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:41.710
are you listening

38
00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:44.810
Hello Yu Seqi

39
00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:45.900
Hello

40
00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:47.370
You speak

41
00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:49.570
Hello

42
00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:53.850
what are you doing

43
00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.740
Really

44
00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:01.640
I'll call you later

45
00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:11.590
Do you also want to take the medical exam?

46
00:03:13.289 --> 00:03:15.730
Have you seen the body?

47
00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:20.380
I'm just lost

48
00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.610
sorry

49
00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:27.470
All the corpses here are nameless corpses

50
00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:30.610
There are not even any family members who come to claim it.

51
00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:34.590
for…

52
00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:40.010
Pursue more perfect surgery
I practice every day

53
00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:42.720
This way…

54
00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:44.970
Isn't it illegal?

55
00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:47.500
Because I can't afford the funeral expenses

56
00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:50.580
These poor people are even refused entry to funeral parlors
I take them in

57
00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.370
Also helped with cremation

58
00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:55.000
This is a good thing for everyone

59
00:03:59.299 --> 00:04:02.380
Do you know how troublesome the district office is for them?

60
00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:07.060
It costs taxpayers a lot of money to bury these bodies together.

61
00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.620
So pitiful

62
00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:19.330
He must have run away from the kindergarten.
street children

63
00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.560
Lord

64
00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.860
There's a lost lamb here

65
00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:29.250
May her soul rest in peace in your kingdom

66
00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:40.790
Want to get into medical school

67
00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:43.580
Don’t be afraid of blood and organs

68
00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.210
You'll soon have the chance to experience it

69
00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:50.610
If you can successfully enter medical school

70
00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:37.970
Jay

71
00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:41.140
Please come in

72
00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.780
This is a detective from the police station

73
00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.300
Came to investigate because of what happened on the day of the school anniversary

74
00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:55.960
Although everyone is busy studying
But please still cooperate fully with the investigation

75
00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:03.740
Fan Xiu doesn’t have many friends

76
00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:07.740
But she wasn't bullied

77
00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.000
There's nothing like that in our school

78
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.560
She chose not to associate with other people.

79
00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.350
She often takes medicine

80
00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:17.610
But I don't know what medicine it is

81
00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:21.540
She was in a bad state that day

82
00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:24.800
Sweated a lot and drank a lot of water

83
00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:27.330
Eyes are also very red

84
00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:30.700
I thought she was sick

85
00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.690
i don't know anything

86
00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:35.110
I am also a victim

87
00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.010
I still have to rely on the harp to get into college

88
00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:40.000
Now my hand is injured and I can't practice at all.

89
00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.680
Finished

90
00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:45.250
Fanxiu was very unhappy because she didn’t make the top 20.

91
00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:50.420
I think if I were not a transfer student
She will definitely get into the top 20

92
00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.820
Transfer students…

93
00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.480
The one she stabbed

94
00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.250
Yu Seqi

95
00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:09.270
Thank you for taking time out of your busy schedule to cooperate with the investigation.

96
00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.440
I want to ask a few questions

97
00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:16.600
Everyone says you and Seulgi are the best friends

98
00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:17.580
is it true

99
00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:25.020
What do you want to know about Seulgi?

100
00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:30.940
Why don't you take a few more days off?

101
00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:33.400
You are really as stubborn as your dad

102
00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:34.680
I'm already a senior in high school

103
00:07:35.119 --> 00:07:36.660
no time to get sick

104
00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:37.700
ok

105
00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:40.640
But don’t forgive others easily

106
00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:45.380
That day…

107
00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:47.730
You didn't come in because there were guests at home, right?

108
00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.600
That's the person sent from the hospital

109
00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.920
Want to talk to me about reconciliation

110
00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:02.860
thank you for telling me

111
00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:16.350
Yu Seqi

112
00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:17.960
Wait

113
00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:19.320
What's wrong

114
00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.460
Principal

115
00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:28.760
Yu Seqi came to school. What should I do now?

116
00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:32.580
Yes

117
00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:34.560
She is next to me now

118
00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:38.730
Didn't expect to meet so soon

119
00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:42.420
But her parents are not here, is that okay?

120
00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:45.910
She had been living in a kindergarten

121
00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:48.480
We also know this

122
00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:52.700
In such an important period of senior year of high school

123
00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:55.190
Affects students’ learning atmosphere

124
00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:59.040
I'm really sorry, principal.

125
00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:09.490
I also have parents

126
00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:13.730
hello lawyer

127
00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.440
It's six o'clock today, right?

128
00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:17.680
Do you want me to go with you?

129
00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:20.170
I'll go by myself today

130
00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:22.960
If anything happens, please contact me immediately

131
00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.640
-Okay thank you
-Okay

132
00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:29.660
[Seulgi]

133
00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:46.300
Teacher, why did you come to school?

134
00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:48.220
I am Yu Seqi's guardian

135
00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:56.790
This incident has a negative impact on the school’s image
had a serious impact

136
00:09:56.790 --> 00:10:00.200
Who was so anxious to call the police?

137
00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.750
Principal, isn't that right?

138
00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:05.640
There are obviously victims

139
00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:07.760
Of course those who commit crimes should be punished

140
00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:12.170
Fortunately, classmate Yu Seqi was not seriously injured.
I'll be back to class soon

141
00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:15.940
This matter could have been resolved on campus
It's too big a fuss now

142
00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:17.380
very regrettable

143
00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:21.160
Before addressing public opinion, I should sincerely apologize.

144
00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.860
Let the victim and perpetrator meet like this

145
00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:27.240
How uncomfortable it must be for Seulgi

146
00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:28.870
You guys are going too far.

147
00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:32.270
Wait, what is a perpetrator?

148
00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:35.110
Did you go too far?

149
00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:39.070
There were so many witnesses at the scene
Saw Beom Soo stabbing Seul Gi with a knife

150
00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:42.710
There were at least dozens or hundreds of witnesses

151
00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:43.800
Details are still under investigation

152
00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.570
Please speak carefully

153
00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:47.820
And just look at the results of things

154
00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:49.260
Although Fan Xiu was at fault

155
00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:51.320
But I heard Seulgi is also responsible

156
00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:56.150
Fan Xiu

157
00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.600
Say it yourself

158
00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:00.770
Fanxiu, you can be honest, it doesn't matter

159
00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:06.480
Seulgi told me

160
00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:11.000
She saw that I was in pain because of my midterm exam results.

161
00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.360
Just gave me some medicine

162
00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.640
He said that if you eat them at the same time, you will feel much better.

163
00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:19.420
Hello Kim Bum Soo

164
00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.740
How can I have

165
00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.120
Classmate Yu Seqi

166
00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:25.930
Is what she said true?

167
00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.170
No

168
00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:33.320
I never gave Fanxiu medicine

169
00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:35.230
Seulgi

170
00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:36.760
if this is true

171
00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:38.610
This is no small matter

172
00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:40.820
what are you doing

173
00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.450
Seulgi, let's go

174
00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:43.740
No

175
00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:46.710
I didn't do anything wrong. Why should I leave?

176
00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:50.020
I never gave Fanxiu medicine

177
00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:53.300
Are you saying that our Fanxiu is lying?

178
00:11:53.300 --> 00:11:55.090
It was obviously you who sold me the medicine

179
00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:57.450
Also taught me how to mix it...

180
00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:00.000
Fan Xiu

181
00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.650
What medicine did Seulgi give you?

182
00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.200
teacher

183
00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:05.820
She said she took six white pills at the same time

184
00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:09.480
Plus a pink one
It will feel like you have ascended to heaven

185
00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:12.810
If drug dealing occurs on campus
this is very serious

186
00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:17.880
She must be thoroughly investigated to see if she is selling drugs.
to other students

187
00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.050
I thought it was just a rumor

188
00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:23.080
I didn’t expect that the problem was actually caused by transfer students.

189
00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.550
not me

190
00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.270
In fact, I just did it a while ago
Personal belongings inspection

191
00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.890
We also conducted individual interviews with students.

192
00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.970
The sayings I’ve heard recently are very similar.

193
00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.240
Recently

194
00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.640
if it is true
This problem has existed for a long time, right?

195
00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:42.910
Convene a school violence committee immediately

196
00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:45.980
Let’s discuss the issue of Yu Seulqi’s withdrawal from school.

197
00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:48.410
I will drop out of school before I find out the facts.

198
00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.480
The person who should drop out of school is Fan Xiu
Not our Seulgi

199
00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:54.900
There is no reason in this world for the victim to drop out of school

200
00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:56.240
not me

201
00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:58.790
You've been saying it's not you since just now

202
00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.700
So do you know who is selling medicine?

203
00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:07.700
I am a detective from Jiangnan Police Station

204
00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.580
Is classmate Yu Seqi here?

205
00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:16.370
We received the report and there is no way we can't ignore it.

206
00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:18.740
Did you steal the medicine at J Medical Center?

207
00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:21.230
What are you doing stealing medicine?

208
00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.410
Did you make money by selling it to your classmates?

209
00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:24.900
why

210
00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.390
not me

211
00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:29.500
I also hope to believe you

212
00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.280
But we have evidence

213
00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:33.870
The day of the health checkup

214
00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:39.090
The surveillance camera captured you in the hospital pharmacy.
hovering nearby

215
00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:40.200
That's...

216
00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:43.780
You were running around in the hospital that day

217
00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:45.660
Are you looking for a pharmacy?

218
00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:48.440
I have what you need most right now

219
00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.220
Do you want to come and get it?

220
00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:52.200
Did you take the medicine you stole that day?

221
00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:54.360
Sold to Kim Bum-soo on the school anniversary day

222
00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:58.750
She ate the "cocktail recipe" you taught her
Just got into trouble

223
00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:01.100
Tell the truth now

224
00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:02.820
The penalty may be reduced

225
00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:05.560
Don’t you want to go to college?

226
00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:10.600
It's Liu Jieyi

227
00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:11.720
Liu Jieyi

228
00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:14.550
People who sell drugs to other students

229
00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:16.500
not me

230
00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:20.040
It's Liu Jieyi

231
00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:22.150
Hello…

232
00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:23.320
Have you heard about it?

233
00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:25.620
Fan Xiu lost control because of the side effects of the drug

234
00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.320
The person who sold her the medicine was Yu Seqi

235
00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:30.850
Super exciting

236
00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:32.700
She really deserves it

237
00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:35.490
Fan Xiu wanted to stab you at that time.

238
00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:37.040
Not Seulgi

239
00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:47.080
Seulgi

240
00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:53.950
Zhao Yaluo

241
00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.040
Come out with the teacher

242
00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:29.720
What did the teacher ask you?

243
00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.720
How does it feel…

244
00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:33.730
Confessed by the most trusted Yu Seqi

245
00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:35.220
what did you say

246
00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:36.620
She told the police

247
00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:41.240
It wasn’t her who sold medicine to Kim Beom-soo, it was you.

248
00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:45.570
so

249
00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:48.220
Then how did you answer

250
00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:50.620
-Do you want to ask me now?
-Hi

251
00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:55.420
I shouldn't have cooperated with you in the first place

252
00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:58.830
You have a great father who will help you deal with the aftermath.

253
00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:00.580
And I have nothing

254
00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:04.020
I'm so stupid for trusting you

255
00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:16.140
That student’s name is Seulgi, right?

256
00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.200
Yes

257
00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:20.560
The school was in an uproar because of this incident

258
00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:23.400
It will be solved soon, don't worry

259
00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:24.600
hope so

260
00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:29.830
You just need to stabilize the mood of the students

261
00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:31.700
I will try my best

262
00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:45.600
Let's go, I'll take you back

263
00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:47.799
I have an appointment

264
00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:49.850
Then let's talk

265
00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:51.079
chat here

266
00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:54.220
Let’s talk about it another day

267
00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:55.700
I have nothing to say to you

268
00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.059
I'll call you later

269
00:17:00.279 --> 00:17:05.020
Liu Jieyi, I don’t feel sorry for you at all

270
00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:09.460
I didn't do anything. Why should I be wronged?

271
00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.940
What did I do wrong?

272
00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:16.880
It's always been like this

273
00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:20.160
Because I'm easy to bully

274
00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:24.860
